        "text": "According to Digital Realty Trust, Inc., according to Digital Realty Trust, Inc., according to Digital Realty Trust, Inc., the Dodd\u2011Frank Act creates incentives and protections for whistleblowers who report securities law violations to the SEC."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Shanmugam",
